cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it and the prior work listed in the report."
title: "Independent verification and a cap-33 extension of the length-14 bounded Andrews-Curtis components"
abstract: >-
  Partial computational result in the SAIR ACC 14-move model: exhaustive cap-33 component enumerations for the
  length-14 Miller-Schupp presentations ac-02089 and ac-08126 (with independent replication), giving model-relative
  peak lower bounds of 34 for paths to AK(3)/the trivial presentation, plus verification of the published capped counts,
  a machine-checkable closure certificate for AK(3) at cap 28, and new elementary AC ledgers. Nothing here proves or
  disproves the Andrews-Curtis conjecture.
